OL,3,AStone to be laid for Mobo founder Kanya
OL,4,AKing
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Paving the Way stone will be
OL,7,Funveiled on 18 November at her former
OL,8,Fschool, Queens Park Community School in
OL,9,FQueen's Park, north-west London.
